{"id": "14-2257-2-10", "zh": "346,367. Ṇeyyo kattikādīhi（从 kattikā 等词之后加 ṇeyya）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2258-2-17", "zh": "从 kattikā 等这些姓氏类词之后，在“他的后裔”这一意义上，可选地加 ṇeyya 词缀。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2259-2-9", "zh": "Kattikā 的后裔是 kattikeyyo，也可以不加词缀，说 kattikāya apaccaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2259-10-38", "zh": "同样有 venateyyo、rohiṇeyyo、gaṅgeyyo、kaddameyyo、nādeyyo、āleyyo、āheyo、kāmeyyo；Suci 的后裔是 soceyyo；还有 sāleyyo、bāleyyo、māleyyo、kāleyyo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2260-2-10", "zh": "347,368. Ato ṇi vā（从 a 之后可选地加 ṇi）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2261-2-16", "zh": "从以 a 结尾的词之后，在“他的后裔”这一意义上，可选地加 ṇi 词缀。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2262-2-9", "zh": "Dakkha 的后裔是 dakkhi，也可以不加词缀，说 dakkhassa apaccaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2262-10-48", "zh": "Duṇa 的后裔是 doṇi，也可以说 duṇassa apaccaṃ；同样有 vāsavi、sakyaputti、nāṭaputti、dāsaputti、dāsavi、vāruṇi、gaṇḍi、bāladevi、pāvaki、jenadatti、buddhi、dhammi、saṅghi、kappi、anuruddhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2263-2-14", "zh": "根据 vā 一词表示可选的意义，在“他的后裔”这一意义上也可以加 ṇika 词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2263-15-18", "zh": "Sakyaputta 的后裔是 sakyaputtiko。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2263-19-23", "zh": "同样有 nāṭaputtiko、jenadattiko。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2264-2-11", "zh": "148,371. Ṇavo’pakvādīhi（从 upaku 等词之后加 ṇava）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2265-2-15", "zh": "从 upaku 等词之后，在“他的后裔”这一意义上，可选地加 ṇava 词缀。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2266-2-9", "zh": "Upaku 的后裔是 opakavo，也可以不加词缀，说 upakussa apaccaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2266-10-17", "zh": "Manu 的后裔是 mānavo，也可以说 manuno apaccaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2266-18-41", "zh": "Bhaggu 的后裔是 bhaggavo，也可以说 bhaggussa apaccaṃ；Paṇḍu 的后裔是 paṇḍavo，也可以说 paṇḍussa apaccaṃ；Bahu 的后裔是 bāhavo，也可以说 bahussa apaccaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2267-2-9", "zh": "349,372. Ṇera vidhavādito（从 vidhavā 等词之后加 ṇera）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2268-2-16", "zh": "从 vidhavā 等词之后，在“他的后裔”这一意义上，可选地加 ṇera 词缀。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2269-2-9", "zh": "寡妇（vidhavā）的后裔是 vedhavero，也可以不加词缀，说 vidhavāya apaccaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2269-10-17", "zh": "Bandhukī 的后裔是 bandhukero，也可以说 bandhukiyā apaccaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2269-18-25", "zh": "沙门（samaṇa）的后裔是 sāmaṇero，也可以说 samaṇassa apaccaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2269-26-36", "zh": "同样有 sāmaṇerī、sāmaṇeraṃ、nāḷikero、nāḷikerī、nāḷikeraṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2270-2-14", "zh": "350,373. Yena vā saṃsaṭṭhaṃ tarati carati vahati ṇiko（在“用某物调和”“借某物渡过”“借某物行走”“用某物运载”的意义上，加 ṇika）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2271-2-22", "zh": "在“用某物调和”“借某物渡过”“借某物行走”“用某物运载”这些意义上，可选地加 ṇika 词缀。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2272-2-11", "zh": "用芝麻（tila）调和的食物是 telikaṃ，也可以不加词缀，说 tilena saṃsaṭṭhaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2272-12-16", "zh": "同样有 goḷikaṃ、ghātikaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2273-2-9", "zh": "乘船（nāvā）渡过的人是 nāviko，也可以说 nāvāya tarati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2273-10-12", "zh": "同样有 oḷumpiko。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2274-2-9", "zh": "乘车（sakaṭa）行走的人是 sākaṭiko，也可以说 sakaṭena carati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2274-10-18", "zh": "同样有 pattiko、daṇḍiko、dhammiko、pādiko。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2275-2-9", "zh": "用头（sīsa）顶运的人是 sīsiko，也可以说 sīsena vahati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2275-10-17", "zh": "用肩（aṃsa）扛运的人是 aṃsiko，也可以说 aṃsena vahati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2275-18-22", "zh": "同样有 khandhiko、aṅguliko。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2276-2-8", "zh": "根据 vā 一词表示可选的意义，在其他意义上也加 ṇika 词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2276-9-16", "zh": "住在王舍城（Rājagaha）的人是 rājagahiko，也可以说 rājagahe vasati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2276-17-24", "zh": "生在王舍城的人是 rājagahiko，也可以说 rājagahe jāto。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2276-25-36", "zh": "同样有 māgadhiko、sāvatthiko、kāpilavatthiko、pāṭaliputtiko、vesāliko。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2277-2-15", "zh": "351,374. Tamadhīte tenakatādisannidhānaniyogasippabhaṇḍajīvikatthesu ca（在“学习某物”“由某物所作”等、“存在于某处”“受任于某处”“技艺”“货品”“生计”这些意义上，也加 ṇika）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2278-2-26", "zh": "在“学习某物”、“由某物所作”等、“存在于某处”、“受任于某处”、“某物是他的技艺”、“某物是他的货品”、“某物是他的生计”这些意义上，也可选地加 ṇika 词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2279-2-8", "zh": "学习律（vinaya）的人是 venayiko，也可以不加词缀，说 vinayamadhīte。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2279-9-15", "zh": "同样有 suttantiko、ābhidhammiko、veyyākaraṇiko。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2280-2-11", "zh": "由身体所作的业是 kāyikaṃ，也可以说 kāyena kataṃ kammaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2280-12-16", "zh": "同样有 vācasikaṃ、mānasikaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2281-2-13", "zh": "存在于身体（sarīra）中的感受是 sārīrikā，也可以说 sarīre sannidhānā；同样有 mānasikā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2282-2-9", "zh": "受任守门（dvāra）的人是 dovāriko，也可以说 dvāre niyutto。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2282-10-16", "zh": "同样有 bhaṇḍāgāriko、nāgariko、nāvakammiko。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2283-2-11", "zh": "以琵琶（vīṇā）为技艺的人是 veṇiko，也可以说 vīṇā assa sippaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2283-12-18", "zh": "同样有 pāṇaviko、modiṅgiko、vaṃsiko。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2284-2-11", "zh": "以香（gandha）为货品的人是 gandhiko，也可以说 gandho assa bhaṇḍaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2284-12-16", "zh": "同样有 teliko、goḷiko。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2285-2-11", "zh": "靠宰杀羊（urabbha）为生的人是 orabbhiko，也可以说 urabbhaṃ hantvā jīvati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2285-12-21", "zh": "靠猎杀鹿（maga）为生的人是 māgaviko，也可以说 magaṃ hantvā jīvati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2285-22-26", "zh": "同样有 sokariko、sākuṇiko。", "confidence": 85}
